this as exploratory and draw no quantitative conclusions from it.\nB.2\nLLM-Assisted Cross-Model Error Categorisation\nTo obtain a functional view of the residual errors, grouping each reference–hypothesis mismatch by error\ntype\nrather than by character class we prompted four independent LLMs (OpenAI", "stderr": "\nShell cwd was reset to /inspire/qb-ilm/project/video-generation/chenxie-25019/hyr/iHateTheWorld555.github.io", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
